// Prime fields, elliptic curves and pairings.
//
// - `montgomery`: `Mont<M>`, a field of a prime below 2^256 in Montgomery
//   form, and the carry-chain word operations; `inversion`: safegcd inverses.
// - `bls_field`, `bls_tower`, `bls_curve`, `bls_map`, `bls_pairing`: BLS12-381.
// - `kzg`, `kzg_lines`: KZG proof verification for the mainnet trusted setup.
// - `bn254_field`, `bn254_curve`, `bn254_pairing`, `bn254`: BN254 (alt_bn128).
// - `secp256k1`: public key recovery. `p256`: ECDSA verification.
